'''Shogakukan Asia Pte. Ltd.''' (Japanese: '''小学館アジア''' ''Shōgakukan Asia'') is an English language manga and children's book publisher based in {{pmin|Singapore}}. They are an official subsidiary of the Japanese publisher [[Shogakukan]]. Their books are available in Singapore, {{wp|Brunei}}, {{pmin|Indonesia}}, {{pmin|Malaysia}}, {{pmin|the Philippines}}, and {{pmin|Thailand}}.

